Account Node : Account Node for the given budget/allocation,         
Budget Type  : Budget Type for the given budget/allocation,   
Start Date      : Budget Start Date, End Date : Budget End Date, 
Amount          : Total allocation amount for the given Account Node, Budget Type, Period and Program.
Activity Reserved Amount : Amount consumed by existing Activities (Active only), 
Activity Available Amount  : Amount available for Activity creation, 
Claim Reserved Amount   : Amount consumed by existing Claims (Active only), 
Claim Available Amount    : Amount available for Claim creation.</value>
