        <shortDescription>Billboard/Transit POP Requirements Information</shortDescription>
        <value>1.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Attribution (POA) – digital media file(s) meeting attribution requirements&lt;br/&gt;

2.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Cost (POC) – itemized invoice issued by a media owner or marketing services agency&lt;br/&gt;

3.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Execution (POE) – report issued by a third party showing:&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;a.&amp;nbsp;One unmodified photo of an actual installation of each version of the ad creative photographed between the ad start and end dates (# of versions = # of installation photos)&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;b.&amp;nbsp;Number of ads, ad sizes, and locations&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;c.&amp;nbsp;Media placement cost per location including installation and removal costs</value>
