        <value>REMEMBER: Events must meet the highest standards of business ethics and integrity and comply with all applicable anti-bribery laws, including the U.S. Foreign Corrupt Practices Act, the UK Bribery Act, and applicable local laws.
Gifts, meals, entertainment or travel costs may only be provided for a legitimate purpose, such as to promote, demonstrate, or explain products and services and must be reasonable and not lavish. These costs will be evaluated in accordance with published guidance and paid accordingly. In no case will Intel reimburse more than the allowed maximum amounts</value>
