    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Joint_Event_POP_Req_Info</fullName>
        <categories>POP Requirements Information</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Joint Event POP Requirements Information</shortDescription>
        <value>If seeking reimbursement for other types of activities as a part of an event (e.g. an online ad promoting the event or a brochure to distribute at the event), POP requirements for those activity types apply.&lt;br/&gt;1. Proof of Attribution (POA)&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;a. For in-person events: at least two photo(s) from completely different angles meeting attribution requirements (for multi-location where attribution is identical, submit photos from only one location)&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;b. For virtual events: screenshot of online interface/presentation meeting attribution requirements&lt;br/&gt;2. Proof of Cost (POC) – itemized Invoice(s) issued by a Third Party (one per claim)&lt;br/&gt;3. Proof of Execution (POE) – Report issued by the Member or a Third Party showing:&lt;br/&gt;a. Number of attendees&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;b. Number that attended each entertainment event that took place outside of the main event venue&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;c. Number of attendees who received gifts&lt;br/&gt;&amp;nbsp;d. Number of government officials and how many received gifts</value>
    </labels>
