    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_NonPartner_com_POP_Req_Info</fullName>
        <categories>POP Requirements Information</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>NonPartner.com POP Requirements Information</shortDescription>
        <value>1.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Attribution (POA) – digital media file(s) meeting attribution requirements&lt;br/&gt;
2.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Cost (POC) – itemized invoice issued by a media owner or marketing services agency&lt;br/&gt;
3.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Execution (POE) – report issued by a media owner or marketing services agency showing:&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;a.&amp;nbsp;For an ad: unit cost (cost per click, per 1,000 impressions, per day, per lead, etc.) and quantity&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;b.&amp;nbsp;For an email: distribution cost and unit cost (cost per sent, per opened, per read, etc.)&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;c.&amp;nbsp;For lead generation: number of impressions, clicks, and leads&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;d.&amp;nbsp;If ad is placed directly with the media owner: website name(s) and URL(s)&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;e.&amp;nbsp;If ad is placed through an ad network: average cost per unit, campaign name and ad network name</value>
    </labels>
