        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MDF_Online_Retail_Campaign_landing_page</shortDescription>
        <value>Retailer to implement and maintain a the retailer campaign landing page. The page content shall be provided or pre-approved by Intel, featuring &lt;Intel-based focus&gt; devices with the correct Intel processor logos (Exhibit A), processor mentions with appropriate trademarks (®/™) and pre-approved Intel messaging as agreed between Retailer and the Intel Account Manager. Retailer shall run the activity as described until the end of the Timeframe. If any conditions stated above are not met, Intel reserves the right to reduce the amounts payable for the activity.</value>
