        <categories>Activity Creation</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MDF_Online_Retargeting</shortDescription>
        <value>Retailer to run an online banner retargeting campaign on a non-PC page of [third-party.com] based on former search terms of the customer. The banner ad shall feature Intel-based focus devices and including the correct Intel processor logos, processor mentions with appropriate trademarks (®/™) and pre-approved Intel messaging as agreed between Retailer and the Intel Account Manager.</value>
