        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Core_MDF_Outcome_Guidelines</shortDescription>
        <value>Baseline Quantity and Goal Quantity are required fields.
Baseline Quantity: Expected value of the outcome metric without this Campaign. Entered prior to execution.
Goal Quantity: Post-Campaign value of the outcome metric we define as success. Entered prior to execution.
Result Quantity: Post-Campaign value of the outcome metric. If this Campaign is Outcome-Based, updated with each claim.
Outcome Criteria: Details that add specificity to the outcome metric (e.g. “compared to the same half last year for server products based on 4th, 5th, and 6th gen Intel Xeon processors”). Entered prior to execution.</value>
    </labels>
