        <value>\n\nJustification:\n\n| Field | Violated Rule |\n|-------|---------------|\n| Activity Title | Does not follow required naming pattern |\n| Description | Lacks clarity on mechanics and eligibility |\n\nCRITICAL RULES:\n- Always start the table on a new line after &apos;Justification:&apos;\n- Use human-readable field labels (e.g., &apos;Activity Title&apos; not &apos;Core_MDF_Activity_Title__c&apos;)\n- Each field should appear only ONCE in the table\n- Only include fields that have actual violations\n- If no violations exist, use: | None | No violations found |\n- Do NOT include dashed separator lines between rows\n- Keep violation descriptions concise and clear\n- Ensure proper markdown table formatting with clean borders\n- No additional text outside the required format&quot;}],&quot;temperature&quot;: 0.3,&quot;top_p&quot;: 0.9,&quot;frequency_penalty&quot;: 0,&quot;presence_penalty&quot;: 0,&quot;max_tokens&quot;: 1000}</value>
