    <labels>
        <fullName>Core_MDF_Seller_Contest_SPIF_POP_Req_Info</fullName>
        <categories>POP Requirements Information</categories>
        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Seller - Contest SPIF POP Requirements Information</shortDescription>
        <value>1.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Attribution (POA) – digital media file(s) meeting attribution requirements&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;a.&amp;nbsp;Promotional materials with program details, sales date range, eligible Intel SKUs, and awards&lt;br/&gt;

2.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Cost (POC) – itemized reports issued by the member or industry partner, showing:&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;a.&amp;nbsp;Sales out report showing sales of eligible products and:&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;bull;&amp;nbsp;For Seller – Target SPIF: calculation of winners, including number of participants, quantity and costs of awards&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;bull;&amp;nbsp;For Seller – Contest SPIF: number of participants, quantity and costs of prizes&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;b.&amp;nbsp;If seeking reimbursement for non-award costs: itemized report issued by a member or third party&lt;br/&gt;

3.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Execution (POE) – Same as POA and POC</value>
    </labels>
