        <language>en_US</language>
        <protected>false</protected>
        <shortDescription>Slotting POP Requirements Information</shortDescription>
        <value>1.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Attribution (POA) – not required&lt;br/&gt;

2.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Cost (POC) – itemized report issued by the member or industry partner, showing:&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;a.&amp;nbsp;Dates, locations and store IDs&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;b.&amp;nbsp;Number and description of slots&lt;br/&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;c.&amp;nbsp;Intel SKU and manufacturer part number/model name &amp; number&lt;br/&gt;

3.&amp;nbsp;Proof of Execution (POE) – same document as POC</value>
    </labels>
